c2.lazyown.org	Intel::DOMAIN	threatdefence-lazyown	LazyOwn high: Zone the LazyOwn C2's built-in DNS server (dnslib on UDP 53 of lhost, on unless enable_c2_dns is false) answers: base64url command labels in front of c2.lazyown.org, TXT answers such as "Servidor C2 activo" and "Ejecutado: <command>" (lazyc2.py:1778-1830). Clients query the C2 address directly, so the lookup may never reach your resolver (LazyOwn operators)	https://github.com/grisuno/LazyOwn/blob/f4e54de958740c421071ac20c98eff1bd6ab7957/lazyc2.py#L1793
